  IconPath: icons/sundries/flags/banner-symbol-sun-gold-red.webp
  Description: 'You devote yourself to a specific cause in your deity''s name. Some
    are limited to sanctification, as noted in parentheses. Your cause adds to your
    edicts and anathema and grants you a special reaction called your champion''s
    reaction, which appears after the divider, along with its upgrades if you gain
    the relentless reaction and exalted reaction class features at higher levels.
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Desecration] (Unholy): You selfishly
    corrupt and destroy. @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Grandeur] (Holy):
    You exemplify the glory and splendor of the celestial realms. @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Iniquity]
    (Unholy): You destroy, take advantage, and act with dishonor. @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Justice]:
    You follow laws and mete out just punishment. @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Liberation]:
    You oppose tyranny and fight for freedom. @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Obedience]:
    You enforce hierarchies and order. @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Redemption]
    (Holy): You try to redeem those who commit wicked deeds.'
  SourceTitle: Pathfinder Player Core 2
  SourcePack: classfeatures
